{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:7b4be2a66f1bb4c0578721cb74d3b5d304d8a5267746f6994fea192640949857",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ed2335d036a817df54852b66f2dcc813d59b48b1608915984602a991c9d893a",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fa14f3b105e43016798c9420dd07509d5d754ff762bfd575e97afe6a786f4ff",
      "text": "前些天承蒙你送我情人节巧克力，\n非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8486fb255ea252f4edb599f038a322b4332f295e5c961f3563ba98bfbb09d92d",
      "text": "作为回礼，我带了这个过来。\n请收下吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ae5fbcec0945530c98c7031c1637c000f89c5bd4b51fe91aaf6fa7a99e74cff",
      "text": "非常感谢。这是茶巾包袱皮吗？\n花纹也很华美雅致呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e8a7d32c6895e64dc8d6b833ba909f76644db3a2c9eca681a3ef907ef7a4fb1",
      "text": "我想着希望能赠送日常中能够实用的物品，\n便选了茶巾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a5a146c1e581679c6262233e378b8a6bf97f5ade9c8fc418c856568394a9a6",
      "text": "制作人平时在各项事务中，\n都对我多有照拂。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4290ab86cafaafd7845449c7d2956f64e1414a4e0f1945fcdb9f109f28c3d597",
      "text": "若能借此传达我的一点感激之情，\n便深感荣幸了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:176e482543ffd951585f061fbd0597239862bf8cdd17cf8ff6e9634cd2cc97fd",
      "text": "好好传达过来了！我非常喜欢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85ceffed4fb93ed3b00e11c482768084ad08979a1b4867b969594676734eccf5",
      "text": "是吗。\n你能喜欢的话，我也感到很高兴。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d37831adfd9da6e44fe56ef5d635ceaf9513b9683a65f5af7a191c36481420bb",
      "text": "请务必在日常中多加使用。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_019_23_5_02_019_23:5_02_019_23:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f8e682cb067bf32cde0f2298b97b5ed255f27008ca542c08530f3eaf3f1a7f5",
      "text": "好的，我会好好珍重使用的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
